考虑批量处理或缓存工作日计算结果，避免重复计算相同日期范围的工作日。对于相同日期范围的任务，可以复用计算结果。
```csharp
// 建议：缓存工作日计算结果
private static readonly ConcurrentDictionary<string, int> _workingDaysCache = new();

var cacheKey = $"{today.Date:yyyyMMdd}_{expectedTestTime.Date:yyyyMMdd}";
if (!_workingDaysCache.TryGetValue(cacheKey, out workingDays))
{
    workingDays = await WorkingDaysCalculator.GetWorkingDaysBetween(today.Date, expectedTestTime.Date);
    _workingDaysCache.TryAdd(cacheKey, workingDays);
}
```

增强异常处理，确保API调用失败时不影响主流程：
```csharp
using var client = new HttpClient { Timeout = TimeSpan.FromSeconds(300) };
try
{
    var response = await client.PostAsync(requestUrl, new StringContent(jsonBody, Encoding.UTF8, "application/json"));
    response.EnsureSuccessStatusCode();
    var taskResultMsg = await response.Content.ReadAsStringAsync();
    // ...
}
catch (TaskCanceledException ex) when (ex.InnerException is TimeoutException)
{
    Env.Logger.Error($"自动格式校正超时: {ex.Message}");
    return newDic; // 返回原始字典，不中断流程
}
catch (Exception ex)
{
    Env.Logger.Error($"自动格式校正失败: {ex.Message}");
    return newDic; // 返回原始字典，不中断流程
}
```

